error[E2106]  a/a.canon:10:6
  label is declared twice (first at a/a.canon:7)

error[E2106]  a/a.canon:12:6
  label is declared twice (first at a/a.canon:10)

error[E2105]  a/a.canon:14:6
  kind is reserved on variant cases

error[E2106]  a/a.canon:16:6
  kind is declared twice (first at a/a.canon:14)

